WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:02.767
[music playing]

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:05.667
[hummingbird twitter]

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:18.367
This male booted racket-tail
hummingbird lives

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:21.900
on the brink of starvation.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:28.834
Just two hours without
nectar, and he could die.

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:32.667
Hummingbirds have the
fastest metabolisms on Earth.

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:41.867
Some need to visit 2,000 flowers
a day just to keep going.

00:00:48.567 --> 00:00:52.166
This mountainous forest
is one of the few jungles

00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:53.166
that is getting wetter.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:59.633
Heavy rain is
predicted to increase.

00:00:59.633 --> 00:01:03.500
And when you weigh
less than a nickel,

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.533
raindrops are a bombardment.

00:01:23.567 --> 00:01:26.366
Waterlogged feathers
slow his progress.

00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:32.699
Staying airborne
becomes more demanding.

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:43.000
But he's running on empty,
and the clock is ticking.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.133
[music playing]

